  "description": "Introducing the all-new Claud Butler Ridge 2.0 electric mountain bike – an upgraded version of the best-selling Ridge 1.0. Now featuring a more powerful Bafang rear hub motor with 45nm of torque, colour display with handlebar remote, 1x9 Shimano Cues gearing and Shimano MT200 hydraulic disc brakes.The Ridge 2.0 is equipped with an integrated 375wh battery that provides up to 40 miles/64km of range and can be charged from flat in 5 hours. The battery can be charged either on the bike or removed for charging off the bike using the provided keys for improved safety and convenience. It features a key lock for the security and peace of mind if locked up in a public place.It is powered by the powerful Bafang rear hub motor that delivers 45nm of torque, making light work of hills and make powering along the flat ground a breeze.The addition of a handlebar display with colour screen and remote is a significant upgrade from the Claud Butler Ridge 1.0. Select from 5 different power modes depending on how much assistance you want, and review more comprehensive ride data such as max speed, average speed, total range, trip range, energy consumed and even CO2 saved. This information is easily selectable via the handlebar mounted remote. We’ve also fitted a walk assist mode to help push the bike along when walking.The Ridge 2.0 features a reliable 1x9 speed Shimano Cues gearing with wide range 11-46T cassette, powerful Shimano MT200 hydraulic disc brakes, 120mm travel suspension fork with hydraulic lock out, super-wide 780mm bars with a short 50mm stem, a stylish Selle Royal saddle for additional comfort and lock-on grips. We’ve fitted the Ridge 2.0 with 27.5” (650b) wheels for an exhilarating ride, while the 2.35” wide tyres provide plenty of grip in mix of riding conditions.The Claud Butler Ridge 2.0 is about getting out on the trails and having fun and is available in two sizes. We recommend the Medium for riders who are 5'4\" to 5'10\" (162cm to 178cm) and Large for riders who are 5'10\" to 6'2\" (178cm to 188cm).",
